  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.1.0:\n\n## Fixed\n- Addressed issues in list numbering when exporting Word documents to PDF or images. (DOC-7493, DOC-7530)\n- Fixed an issue where DataTemplate.Validate incorrectly reported \"Could not find data member\" errors for valid nested range tags in DOCX templates. (DOC-7562)\n- Improved reliability of Calc functions in DOCX templates when processing in multithreaded environments. (DOC-7568)",
